    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86949" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδηλ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make clear beforehand, show plainly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μέλλοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.46.10
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ προδηλούμενα
			πρόσωπα</span> the <i>aforesaid</i> persons, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(7).239.23
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1234.4
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Lycia</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>give instructions beforehand,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Parth.
				17.3
			</span></i>.</div>
